{"4185920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Osman Ghazi: Ottoman Rising", "steam_appid": 4185920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the turbulent world of 13th-century Anatolia, where empires crumble and new powers rise from the ashes.<br>Play as <strong>Osman Gazi</strong>, founder of the Ottoman Empire, and lead your tribe through political intrigue, brutal warfare, and a land filled with shifting alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dense forests, valleys, fortresses, and ancient caravan trade routes. Master horseback combat, stealth infiltration, and strategic raids. Recruit loyal warriors like Turgut and Bala, upgrade your settlement, and battle the Mongols, Byzantines, and rival beyliks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission pushes Osman closer to becoming the leader history remembers. From covert assassinations to large-scale sieges, your choices shape the rise of an empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong><br>• Dynamic third-person melee combat inspired by classic action adventures<br>• Stealth missions, infiltration, and tactical takedowns<br>• Large open regions with horseback travel<br>• Settlement growth and resource management<br>• Companion-based combat with iconic warriors from Osman’s story<br>• Historically grounded world blended with Sufi mysticism and Osman’s legendary dream<br>• Epic conquest missions featuring castles, skirmishes, and rival factions</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the turbulent world of 13th-century Anatolia, where empires crumble and new powers rise from the ashes.<br>Play as <strong>Osman Gazi</strong>, founder of the Ottoman Empire, and lead your tribe through political intrigue, brutal warfare, and a land filled with shifting alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dense forests, valleys, fortresses, and ancient caravan trade routes. Master horseback combat, stealth infiltration, and strategic raids. Recruit loyal warriors like Turgut and Bala, upgrade your settlement, and battle the Mongols, Byzantines, and rival beyliks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission pushes Osman closer to becoming the leader history remembers. From covert assassinations to large-scale sieges, your choices shape the rise of an empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong><br>• Dynamic third-person melee combat inspired by classic action adventures<br>• Stealth missions, infiltration, and tactical takedowns<br>• Large open regions with horseback travel<br>• Settlement growth and resource management<br>• Companion-based combat with iconic warriors from Osman’s story<br>• Historically grounded world blended with Sufi mysticism and Osman’s legendary dream<br>• Epic conquest missions featuring castles, skirmishes, and rival factions</p>", "short_description": "A third-person action adventure set in 13th-century Anatolia. Rise as Osman Gazi, hunt, fight, infiltrate enemy strongholds, and forge the foundations of an empire. Explore a vast historical world shaped by conquest, betrayal, and the birth of a legend.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185920/2f263bf796176d00e2541d2c786f7108b99378c8/header.jpg?t=1766791071", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185920/943d680387a2390a44795ddaded6f5463fea01a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766791071", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4185920/943d680387a2390a44795ddaded6f5463fea01a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766791071", "website": "https://www.ottomanrising.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl